            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384180/extras/51785732ec94efededd0397cc6af8edd.poster.avif?t=1780417469\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384180/extras/51785732ec94efededd0397cc6af8edd.webm?t=1780417469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384180/extras/51785732ec94efededd0397cc6af8edd.mp4?t=1780417469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Rise to Prominence</strong><br><br>Welcome to Prominence Poker, a card game that pits players from around the world against each other – and devious AI – to build the rep, prestige, and bankroll needed to be, and beat, the best of the best. <br><br>A single hand can make all the difference in this immersive free-to-play Steam Texas Hold 'em title — do you have what it takes to be prominent in this town?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384180/extras/5b419b4b94db1dd446c457ea82a1d9e2.avif?t=1780417469\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br><strong>Rich Single-Player Story &amp; Setting</strong><br><br>Set in the city of Prominence, a gambling paradise founded by crooked folks looking to go straight, the solo story mode pits you against four factions and their leaders as you play your way to a final showdown with &quot;The Mayor&quot; – the mysterious town founder who will guide you through your career. Can you prove you’re worthy of The Mayor’s time?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384180/extras/a850728943297cc110a0ca57b1999ac1.avif?t=1780417469\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br><strong>Robust Online Community</strong><br><br>Players will find a rewarding multiplayer experience with regularly scheduled events, daily challenges, tournaments, ranked modes, and even more as the game evolves over time.<br><br>Only in Prominence can you find the thrill of high-stakes poker while risking everything to take over this underground empire from The Mayor. It’s the perfect card game to wage big bets in high-stakes poker against other crafty gamblers from across the world in ring, tournament, and heads-up modes, or simply play with friends in a casual round of poker.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384180/extras/284cc72e37309e0f92b84acd7f8f5fd7.avif?t=1780417469\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br><strong>Avatar Customization &amp; Table Items</strong><br><br>Customization is a key component of Prominence Poker and a place where it differs from other card games in its space. There’s an in-depth selection of sliders for your character’s appearance, from colored hair to thin or pouty lips to forehead dimensions. Respective headwear, accessories, and tattoos tabs exist to further customize the physical appearance of your poker avatar – to fit in or command the attention of everyone at the table.<br><br>Table items play a key role, too. Whether it’s a glass of iced tea, a shot of vodka, or a cigar, these items provide experience boosts and are a smart way of diverting the attention away from players’ cards – where all the attention should be.",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384180/extras/51785732ec94efededd0397cc6af8edd.poster.avif?t=1780417469\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384180/extras/51785732ec94efededd0397cc6af8edd.webm?t=1780417469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384180/extras/51785732ec94efededd0397cc6af8edd.mp4?t=1780417469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Rise to Prominence</strong><br><br>Welcome to Prominence Poker, a card game that pits players from around the world against each other – and devious AI – to build the rep, prestige, and bankroll needed to be, and beat, the best of the best. <br><br>A single hand can make all the difference in this immersive free-to-play Steam Texas Hold 'em title — do you have what it takes to be prominent in this town?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384180/extras/5b419b4b94db1dd446c457ea82a1d9e2.avif?t=1780417469\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br><strong>Rich Single-Player Story &amp; Setting</strong><br><br>Set in the city of Prominence, a gambling paradise founded by crooked folks looking to go straight, the solo story mode pits you against four factions and their leaders as you play your way to a final showdown with &quot;The Mayor&quot; – the mysterious town founder who will guide you through your career. Can you prove you’re worthy of The Mayor’s time?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384180/extras/a850728943297cc110a0ca57b1999ac1.avif?t=1780417469\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br><strong>Robust Online Community</strong><br><br>Players will find a rewarding multiplayer experience with regularly scheduled events, daily challenges, tournaments, ranked modes, and even more as the game evolves over time.<br><br>Only in Prominence can you find the thrill of high-stakes poker while risking everything to take over this underground empire from The Mayor. It’s the perfect card game to wage big bets in high-stakes poker against other crafty gamblers from across the world in ring, tournament, and heads-up modes, or simply play with friends in a casual round of poker.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384180/extras/284cc72e37309e0f92b84acd7f8f5fd7.avif?t=1780417469\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br><strong>Avatar Customization &amp; Table Items</strong><br><br>Customization is a key component of Prominence Poker and a place where it differs from other card games in its space. There’s an in-depth selection of sliders for your character’s appearance, from colored hair to thin or pouty lips to forehead dimensions. Respective headwear, accessories, and tattoos tabs exist to further customize the physical appearance of your poker avatar – to fit in or command the attention of everyone at the table.<br><br>Table items play a key role, too. Whether it’s a glass of iced tea, a shot of vodka, or a cigar, these items provide experience boosts and are a smart way of diverting the attention away from players’ cards – where all the attention should be.",
            "short_description": "Welcome to Prominence Poker, a card game that pits players from around the world against each other – and devious AI – to build the rep, prestige, and bankroll needed to be, and beat, the best of the best.",
